sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Dispatcher
  participant E as Engine
  participant L as SQLite ledger
  participant H as Google Sheets
  participant C as Google Calendar
  participant S as Slack
  participant G as Gmail
  D->>E: POST approve plan
  E->>H: re-read Technicians Jobs Travel tabs
  E->>C: re-list events on every tech calendar
  alt fresh fingerprint differs from plan
    E-->>D: plan marked stale, nothing written
  else fingerprint matches
    Note over E,L: every write is marked pending, then done, under a stable key
    E->>C: insert event with deterministic id
    E->>C: delete old bookings
    E->>H: update job row
    E->>S: find_by_key then post routes and dispatch summary
    E->>G: find_by_key then send with key tag
    E->>C: read all calendars back
    E->>H: read Jobs tab back
    E->>S: find_by_key for each post
    E->>G: find_by_key for each email
    E-->>D: pass fail checklist after check_schedule
  end
